Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:45.90,H_fil,,0,0,0,,Isinilid ng system ang gym bro sa nakaraan... para maging strategist?!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:45.90,C_fil,,0,0,0,,Panuorin LAHAT — LIBRE ▶ YT688.app
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:00.94,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Utak ang pinapatakbo ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.88,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Nagbuhat ka nga ng bato ng libong kilo nang walang hawak,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.92,0:00:03.28,S_fil,,0,0,0,,at 'yun ang tawag mo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.32,0:00:05.28,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Nag-aral ka ba ng martial arts?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.32,0:00:06.28,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Hindi pa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.32,0:00:07.28,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Nag-ge-gym lang ako para kumain —
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.32,0:00:09.28,S_fil,,0,0,0,,ang muscles ko hindi martial arts.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.32,0:00:10.28,S_fil,,0,0,0,,pero may nakatagong milyong hukbo sa loob ko,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.32,0:00:12.28,S_fil,,0,0,0,,ang natatagong dragon ng panahong ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.34,0:00:14.34,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Kasalanan ng system na 'to:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.38,0:00:16.34,S_fil,,0,0,0,,maghanap ng strategist sa loob ng 3 araw —
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.38,0:00:17.34,S_fil,,0,0,0,,kung bagsak ako,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.38,0:00:18.34,S_fil,,0,0,0,,magiging eunuch ako!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.38,0:00:19.34,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Karangalan ng lalaki ang nakataya!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.38,0:00:21.34,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Mamatay man ako, strategist pa rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.38,0:00:22.34,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Bayaning Li,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.38,0:00:24.34,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Sumali sa hukbo ko bilang heneral.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.38,0:00:25.34,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Titiyakin kong sikat ka.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.38,0:00:26.34,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Paalam na po.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.38,0:00:28.34,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Kung pipilitin niyong maging brute ako,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.38,0:00:29.34,S_fil,,0,0,0,,sa ibang mabuting panginoon na lang ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.38,0:00:31.30,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Bayani,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.34,0:00:32.30,S_fil,,0,0,0,,kung lumipat ka sa kampeng kalaban,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.34,0:00:33.30,S_fil,,0,0,0,,anong panlaban ng kaharian namin?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.34,0:00:36.19,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Ako,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.23,0:00:37.89,S_fil,,0,0,0,,pumayag.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.93,0:00:38.89,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Salamat, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.93,0:00:39.89,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Buo ang buhay kong paglilingkuran kayo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.93,0:00:40.89,S_fil,,0,0,0,,at gumawa ng estratehiya para sa inyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.93,0:00:41.89,S_fil,,0,0,0,,[Ding!]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.93,0:00:42.89,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Congrats, host: strategist na-hire!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.93,0:00:44.89,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Mission complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.93,0:00:45.89,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Padadalhan na ng reward...
